	(text "thriller module: PG2L50H-6IMBG324 + QSPI flash + ST33KTPM2X TPM + PSRAM + RTC + LAN8742A PHY + 25 MHz XO + regulators, on a potted 20 x ~40 mm card\nwith two Hirose DF40C-80DP-0.4V(51) connectors (J1 power/control/ciphertext, J2 audio/display/clocks/GPIO). See hw/module.md.\n\nPower: 5 V always on from J1 -> 3V3_AO (RTC, power control). EN_PWR (PB_N_AO | RTC alarm | PWR_HOLD) -> 1V0 -> 1V8 -> 3V3 -> PGOOD.\nAll I/O banks at 3.3 V. Everything with a connector, transducer or user interface is on the carrier.\nSymbols: thriller.kicad_sym (project) and FPGA_Pango_Logos2.kicad_sym. Nets between pages use global labels."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 25 0)
